289	     * The owner's locality, read from its {@link #getMemberId() member id}: the
290	     * {@code REGION} segment of the member id (see {@link MemberId#regionOf}). Falls back to
291	     * the owner's live {@link #getRegion() region} until a member id has been assigned.
292	     */
293	    @Transient
