415	     * Whether this owner, when created, softly matched an already-stored owner: one whose
416	     * last name shares its {@link Soundex} code and whose postcode matches, while their
417	     * {@link #getIdentityKey() identity keys} differ. Assigned on create; when {@code true},
418	     * {@link #getPossibleDuplicateOf()} identifies the matched owner.
419	     */
